                    defense_integrated:     `The integrated balance — capacity, access, affordability and fiscal discipline shown together, with the trade-offs named honestly`,
                    metric_mw:              `Megawatts contracted — the headline the press will print`,
                    metric_delivered:       `Delivered MW that actually reach the grid at a clearing price within the subsidy ceiling — the number that survives 24 months`,
                    metric_lowestbid:       `The lowest bid we achieved — proof we were tough on cost`,

                    warn_rigour_range:      `Diagnostic rigour must be a percentage between 0 and 100.`,
